          spawnedAt: t0,
          tokens: 5000,
        ),
        at: at(10),
      );
      // Inside the 3 s flash window: still bright.
      expect(region.rows(now: at(12), width: 100).single.bright, isTrue);
      // Past the window: the dim one-line summary persists.
